repository-code: "https://github.com/Nigel886/MIND"

license: MIT

version: "0.5.0.dev0"

abstract: >
  MIND (Meta-Inference Network Dynamics) is a specification-driven research
  artifact containing an immutable cognitive runtime, a bounded Goal-Directed
  Agent, deterministic Meta-Inference capability selection, and a frozen local
  comparative-evaluation protocol. It does not claim general intelligence,
  adaptive learning, or comparative superiority.
